Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.49,0:00:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想借这个机会谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just want take a moment and thank you guys
