Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有你们我绝对办不到{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I really couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}过去的九个月我很开心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I loved these last 9 months.
