Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You.
