Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道你现在很痛苦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know how miserable you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我真的希望能帮上忙{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I wish there was something I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我希望自己是海马{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I wish I were a sea horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.19,0:01:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为是公海马负责孵育小宝宝{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because with sea horses, it's the male. They carry the babies.
