Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我这辈子从来没有这么难受过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I have never been so uncomfortable in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我了解  我也有过这种经历  我记得最后{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know. I've been there. I remember toward the end...
