Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}能不能帮我拿杯冰茶来再说{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Can you tell it to me when you're getting me some iced tea?
