Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}公司要我回家{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They sent me home from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们让我从现在就开始休产假  回家休息{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They said, "Start your maternity leave now. Just rest."
