Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好消息  我帮搞你到了首映会的门票{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Great news. I was able to get you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你可以带一位朋友出席{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}and one guest tickets to your premiere.
