Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.01,0:04:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You hear that?
